Description:
  Prepares verified MSBuild imports without starting resources.

Usage:
  Hexalith.Builds.Module.Cli prepare-build [options]

Options:
  --manifest <manifest> (REQUIRED)
  --workspace <workspace> (REQUIRED)
  --mode <package|source> (REQUIRED)
  --output <human|json>               [default: human]
  -?, -h, --help                      Show help and usage information

